Civic Ledger\par
\par
NOT TESTED YET. This installer and the full uninstaller have not been verified on a clean Windows PC. Use them at your own risk.\par
\par
This installer copies the Civic Ledger Start/Stop app and the local Docker stack into your user profile.\par
\par
A new PC also needs WSL 2, Docker Desktop, and Ollama. WSL 2 is a major Windows feature that adds a Linux kernel for Docker. Use CivicLedgerSetup.exe so those requirements are explained and installed before Civic Ledger is copied. You can uninstall Civic Ledger later and optionally remove Docker, Ollama, and WSL 2.\par
\par
It does not download AI models by itself. After install, open Civic Ledger from the Start menu. You can pick a model already on this PC, or confirm before downloading the default model (qwen3:8b, about 5 GB).\par
\par
Civic Ledger only uses public political records. It does not collect private personal data.\par
\par
